trade_share   lng           lncap         ln_unesco     lnz           lnpop         n_air         eig_sum       close_mean    regimp_sum    cap_mean      merch_share   tourism_cum   ln_sea_ma
ln_tradevol   ln_gaci_cwm   gaci_cwmean   unesco_cum    lnz_own       lnland        deg_sum       eig_mean      betw_sum      regimp_mean   tour_shift    merch_inte~y  ln_remote     ln_air_ma

